 "logline": "A dog can't keep a poker face: at Saxo's poker night by his pool, every good hand sets his tongue flopping and every bad one makes him sob, so the cat who never moves a whisker takes every pot; down to his last stack he lets the 'deal with it' sunglasses drop onto his face, goes all in with a seven and a two, and the cat folds her aces; he can't hold the win in, and his victory kick sends the whole pot into the pool, where the video loops back to him rising out of it.",
